-# Public demo v3.6.2 · undo and MYR purchase prices
-
-This update preserves the existing Netlify site, Google browser OAuth client, visitor-owned Runpod integration, Meta WhatsApp and 360dialog personal sandbox interfaces. No owner API keys are bundled.
